<title>USA: Hickory Tech to expand competitive services.</title>
<headline>Hickory Tech to expand competitive services.</headline>
<dateline>MANKATO, Minn. 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hickory Tech Corp said Wednesday it created a new entity designed to provide competitive services to customers currently served by other telephone companies.</p>
<p>The new Crystal Communications unit of Hickory Tech's new Strategic Business Development Sector will offer communications service in other areas, initially in Minnesota and Iowa, the company said.</p>
<p>Hickory Tech is a communications holding comnpany.</p>
<p>Its shares were unchanged at 28-1/2 in afternoon trading.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
